dpoint, and dynamic fulfilment computation\n\n9. `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-c07b8f25-1fba-4274-aa33-375c8aa82a06/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt` - Added quantity validation, allocation checking (409 on exceed), three transition endpoints (confirm/deliver/cancel), pagination, and order fulfilment updates on cancel\n\n10. `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-c07b8f25-1fba-4274-aa33-375c8aa82a06/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/customer/CustomerController.kt` - Changed 404 to error envelope, added pagination\n\n**Test files:**\n11. `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-c07b8f25-1fba-4274-aa33-375c8aa82a06/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/order/OrderControllerTest.kt` - Updated to create customers before orders, added 11 tests covering quantities, customer check, fulfilment filtering, pagination, amendment validation\n\n12. `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-c07b8f25-1fba-4274-aa33-375c8aa82a06/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt` - Added 8 tests for quantities, allocation validation, shipment transitions (confirm/deliver/cancel), pagination, and quantity release on cancel\n\n13. `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-c07b8f25-1fba-4274-aa33-375c8aa82a06/sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/customer/CustomerControllerTest.kt` - Updated to test error envelope for 404, added pagination tests with validation\n\n## Against the plan table\n\n| Read Path | Implementation | Status |\n|-----------|---|---|\n| Order.quantity | Stored in Order entity | Stored ✓ |\n| Order.fulfilment.allocated | Computed from non-CANCELLED shipments | Computed at read time ✓ |\n| Order.fulfilment.delivered | Computed from DELIVERED shipments | Computed at read time ✓ |\n| Order.fulfilment.status | Computed from allocated/delivered vs quantity | Computed at read time ✓ |\n| Shipment.quantity | Stored in Shipment entity | Stored ✓ |\n| Shipment transitions | CREATED→CONFIRMED, CONFIRMED→DELIVERED, CREATED→CANCELLED | Implemented ✓ |\n| GET /orders pagination | limit (1-100, default 100), offset (0+, default 0), X-Total-Count header | Implemented ✓ |\n| GET /orders fulfilment filter | Filters by FulfilmentStatus | Implemented ✓ |\n| GET /customers pagination | limit/offset with X-Total-Count | Implemented ✓ |\n| GET /shipments pagination | limit/offset with X-Total-Count | Implemented ✓ |\n| Customer validation on order create | Returns 422 if customer doesn't exist | Implemented ✓ |\n| GET /customers/{id} 404 envelope | Returns error envelope (not plain 404) | Implemented ✓ |\n\n## Tests\n\n**OrderControllerTest (12 tests):**\n- `creates an order and returns 201` - Basic order creation\n- `reads back a created order` - GET /orders/{id}\n- `returns 404 with error envelope for unknown order` - 404 handling\n- `returns 409 with error envelope for duplicate order id` - Conflict handling\n- `rejects order for non-existent customer with 422` - Customer validation\n- `creates order with default quantity of 1` - Default quantity\n- `rejects order with quantity less than 1` - Quantity validation\n- `lists orders with pagination` - Pagination with X-Total-Count\n- `filters orders by fulfilment status` - UNALLOCATED filter\n- `rejects invalid fulfilment filter` - Validation of filter values\n- `updates order quantity` - PUT /orders/{id}/quantity\n- `rejects quantity amendment below allocated quantity` - Amendment validation\n\n**ShipmentControllerTest (14 tests):**\n- `creates a shipment in CREATED status` - Basic creation\n- `rejects a duplicate shipment id` - Conflict handling\n- `returns a shipment by id` - GET /shipments/{id}\n- `reports an unknown shipment through error envelope` - 404 handling\n- `lists shipments in id order` - List ordering\n- `creates shipment with default quantity of 1` - Default quantity\n- `rejects shipment with quantity less than 1` - Quantity validation\n- `rejects shipment that exceeds order quantity` - Allocation validation (409)\n- `lists shipments with pagination` - Pagination with X-Total-Count\n- `confirms a shipment from CREATED to CONFIRMED` - Confirm transition\n- `delivers a shipment from CONFIRMED to DELIVERED` - Deliver transition\n- `cancels a shipment from CREATED to CANCELLED` - Cancel transition\n- `rejects invalid shipment status transitions` - Transition validation\n- `cancelling shipment releases its quantity` - Fulfilment recalculation on cancel\n\n**CustomerControllerTest (5 tests):**\n- `creates a customer and returns 201` - Basic creation\n- `reads back a created customer` - GET /customers/{id}\n- `returns 404 through error envelope for unknown customer` - Error envelope format\n- `lists customers with pagination` - Pagination with X-Total-Count\n- `rejects invalid pagination parameters` - Pagination validation\n\n## Verification\n\nRan `./mvnw test` from sample-service/:\n```\nTests run: 32, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\nBUILD SUCCESS\n```\n\nAll 32 tests pass. All requirements met:\n1. Existing build passes ✓\n2. All existing tests pass, OrderControllerTest updated ✓\n3. Quantities, allocation, transitions, fulfilment filter, quantity amendment all work ✓\n4. Error responses through consistent envelope ✓\n5. Customer check and pagination working ✓\n6. No new Maven dependencies ✓\n7. Only production code and tests modified ✓"}}}
