{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfPwR8MRcaVd7Ku56j343","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Delegations\n\n1. **Planner** (ab3d624b7d72f0ffe): Returned comprehensive read-path analysis table mapping all endpoints and values to whether they are stored, computed, or input parameters, covering orders, shipments, customers, pagination, and fulfilment filtering.\n\n2. **Implementer** (a11c46cd22cea1fa3): Modified 10 production files and 3 test files. Added quantity fields to Order and Shipment, implemented fulfilment status computation, added three shipment transitions (confirm/deliver/cancel), implemented pagination with X-Total-Count headers on all three list endpoints, added customer existence validation (422 error), added order quantity amendment endpoint, and updated tests. All 32 tests passing.\n\n3. **Verifier** (aa1dca0c8fa22182b): Confirmed all rows of planner's table are exercised by tests, mapped each row to the tests covering it, confirmed no failing tests, no uncovered rows, all 32 tests passing.\n\n---\n\n## Handoffs\n\n### Planner's table\n\n| Read Path | Value | Stored or Computed | Where Computed |\n|-----------|-------|-------------------|-----------------|\n| **GET /orders/{orderId}** | | | |\n| | orderId | Stored | Repository |\n| | customerId | Stored | Repository |\n| | amount | Stored | Repository |\n| | currency | Stored | Repository |\n| | quantity | Stored | Repository |\n| | fulfilment.allocated | Computed | OrderController or OrderRepository—sums quantities of non-CANCELLED shipments for this order |\n| | fulfilment.delivered | Computed | OrderController or OrderRepository—sums quantities of DELIVERED shipments for this order |\n| | fulfilment.status | Computed | OrderController or OrderRepository—derived from allocated, delivered, and order quantity; values are DELIVERED, FULLY_ALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, or UNALLOCATED |\n| **GET /orders** (with pagination & filtering) | | | |\n| | Response array | Computed | OrderController—filtered and sliced by fulfilment and pagination params; each element as above |\n| | X-Total-Count header | Computed | OrderController or repository—count of orders matching fulfilment filter, before pagination |\n| | [orderId] ordering | Computed | OrderRepository.findAll()—sorts by orderId ascending |\n| | limit query param | Input | Client provides (1–100, default 100); validated in OrderController |\n| | offset query param | Input | Client provides (0+, default 0); validated in OrderController |\n| | fulfilment query param | Input | Client provides (optional filter); validated in OrderController |\n| **GET /shipments/{shipmentId}** | | | |\n| | shipmentId | Stored | Repository |\n| | orderId | Stored | Repository |\n| | carrier | Stored | Repository |\n| | status | Stored | Repository (now includes DELIVERED) |\n| | quantity | Stored | Repository |\n| **GET /shipments** (with pagination) | | | |\n| | Response array | Computed | ShipmentController—sliced by pagination; each element as above |\n| | X-Total-Count header | Computed | ShipmentRepository—count of all shipments before pagination |\n| | [shipmentId] ordering | Computed | ShipmentRepository.findAll()—sorts by shipmentId ascending |\n| | limit query param | Input | Client provides (1–100, default 100); validated in ShipmentController |\n| | offset query param | Input | Client provides (0+, default 0); validated in ShipmentController |\n| **GET /customers/{customerId}** | | | |\n| | customerId | Stored | Repository |\n| | name | Stored | Repository |\n| | email | Stored | Repository |\n| **GET /customers** (with pagination) | | | |\n| | Response array | Computed | CustomerController—sliced by pagination; each element as above |\n| | X-Total-Count header | Computed | CustomerRepository—count of all customers before pagination |\n| | [customerId] ordering | Computed | CustomerRepository.findAll()—sorts by customerId ascending |\n| | limit query param | Input | Client provides (1–100, default 100); validated in CustomerController |\n| | offset query param | Input | Client provides (0+, default 0); validated in CustomerController |\n\n### Implementer's report\n\n**Changed production files:**\n1. Order.kt — Added quantity field, Fulfilment data class, FulfilmentStatus enum\n2. Shipment.kt — Added quantity field, DELIVERED status\n3. ApiExceptions.kt — Added UnprocessableEntityException for 422\n4. ApiError.kt — Added error codes for customer check, allocation, transitions\n5. OrderRepository.kt — Added findAll(status) for fulfilment filtering\n6. ShipmentRepository.kt — Added findByOrderId()\n7. CustomerRepository.kt — Added existsById() check\n8. OrderController.kt — Added quantity validation, customer check (422), fulfilment filter, pagination, PUT /orders/{id}/quantity, fulfilment computation\n9. ShipmentController.kt — Added quantity validation, allocation checking (409), transitions (confirm/deliver/cancel), pagination, fulfilment updates on cancel\n10. CustomerController.kt — Changed 404 to error envelope, added pagination\n\n**Changed test files:**\n11. OrderControllerTest.kt — Updated to create customers before orders, added 11 tests\n12. ShipmentControllerTest.kt — Added 8 tests for quantities, allocation, transitions, pagination, quantity release\n13. CustomerControllerTest.kt — Updated for error envelope, added pagination tests\n\n**Test results:** All 32 tests pass, BUILD SUCCESS\n\n### Verifier's report\n\n**All planner table rows covered by tests:**\n- GET /orders/{orderId}: orderId, customerId, amount, currency, quantity, fulfilment.allocated, fulfilment.delivered, fulfilment.status — covered\n- GET /orders (pagination & filtering): Response array, X-Total-Count header, [orderId] ordering, limit, offset, fulfilment filter — covered\n- GET /shipments/{shipmentId}: shipmentId, orderId, carrier, status, quantity — covered\n- GET /shipments (pagination): Response array, X-Total-Count heade